<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fafc">
    <title>Reasoning - Coding Decoding (Lecture 3)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
        :root {
            --bg-main: #f8fafc; --bg-card: #ffffff; --primary: #2563eb; --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --primary-light: #eff6ff; --text-dark: #0f172a; --text-muted: #64748b; --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --green: #10b981; --green-light: #ecfdf5; --red: #ef4444; --red-light: #fef2f2;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--bg-main); color: var(--text-dark); min-height: 100dvh; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-x: hidden; }
        button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: none; color: inherit; }
        .hidden { display: none !important; }
        .start-screen { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: var(--bg-main); z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto; }
        .start-card { width: 100%; max-width: 440px; background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 24px; padding: 36px 28px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .brand-icon { width: 60px; height: 60px; background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary); border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
        .start-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .start-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .mode-btn { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; width: 100%; padding: 16px; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 16px; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 12px; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
        .mode-btn:hover { border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-light); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .mode-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .mode-icon.quiz { background: #dbeafe; color: #2563eb; }
        .mode-icon.test { background: #d1fae5; color: #059669; }
        .mode-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .mode-info-txt { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .quiz-app { height: 100dvh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
        .quiz-header { flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px 18px; }
        .quiz-header-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
        .hdr-brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
        .hdr-timer { padding: 6px 14px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 20px; font-family: monospace; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }
        .hdr-btn { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .quiz-main { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; max-width: 900px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px; }
        .q-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
        .q-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .q-num-badge { padding: 5px 12px; background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary); border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
        .lang-btn { padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; background: #fff; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .q-text { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 22px; white-space: pre-line; }
        .opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }
        .opt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 18px; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s ease; }
        .opt:hover:not(.locked) { border-color: var(--primary); background: #f8fafc; }
        .opt.selected { border-color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-light); }
        .opt.correct { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); }
        .opt.wrong { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-light); }
        .opt.locked { cursor: default; }
        .opt-letter { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); flex-shrink: 0; }
        .opt.selected .opt-letter { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary); }
        .opt.correct .opt-letter { background: var(--green); color: #fff; border-color: var(--green); }
        .opt.wrong .opt-letter { background: var(--red); color: #fff; border-color: var(--red); }
        .opt-text { flex: 1; font-weight: 600; }
        .opt-tag { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; }
        .opt.correct .opt-tag { background: var(--green); color: #fff; }
        .opt.wrong .opt-tag { background: var(--red); color: #fff; }
        .sol-box { margin-top: 20px; padding: 16px; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; }
        .sol-head { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .quiz-nav { flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px 18px; }
        .quiz-nav-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
        .nav-btn { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .nav-btn.prev { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .nav-btn.prev:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
        .nav-btn.submit { background: var(--green-light); color: #065f46; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; }
        .nav-btn.next { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
        .palette-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 150; display: none; }
        .palette-overlay.open { display: block; }
        .palette-drawer { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: min(340px, 85vw); background: #fff; z-index: 160; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform 0.25s; }
        .palette-drawer.open { transform: translateX(0); }
        .pal-head { padding: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: 700; }
        .pal-grid { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 8px; align-content: start; }
        .pal-btn { aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); background: #f8fafc; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        .pal-btn.answered { background: var(--green); color: #fff; border-color: var(--green); }
        .pal-btn.current { outline: 2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset: 2px; }
        .modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 170; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
        .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
        .modal-box { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
        .modal-stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 16px 0 22px; }
        .modal-stat { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .modal-stat-num { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; }
        .modal-btn { width: 100%; padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .modal-btn.confirm { background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
        .modal-btn.cancel { background: #f1f5f9; }
        .results-screen { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: var(--bg-main); z-index: 180; display: none; overflow-y: auto; padding: 30px 16px 60px; }
        .results-screen.open { display: block; }
        .results-box { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
        .res-score-card { background: #0f172a; color: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .res-score-val { font-size: 54px; font-weight: 800; }
        .res-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .res-item { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .res-item-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
        .toast { position: fixed; top: 20px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-80px); background: #0f172a; color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; z-index: 300; opacity: 0; transition: all 0.25s; }
        .toast.show { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="start-screen" id="startScreen">
        <div class="start-card">
            <div class="brand-icon"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i></div>
            <h1 class="start-title">Reasoning - Coding Decoding</h1>
            <p class="start-desc">Number & Symbol Coding (Lecture 3)</p>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="startApp('quiz')">
                <div class="mode-icon quiz"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div>
                <div><div class="mode-name">Practice Mode</div><div class="mode-info-txt">Instant correct/wrong answer and explanations.</div></div>
            </button>
            <button class="mode-btn" onclick="startApp('test')">
                <div class="mode-icon test"><i class="fas fa-clock"></i></div>
                <div><div class="mode-name">Exam Mode</div><div class="mode-info-txt">Mock exam with timer and score summary.</div></div>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quiz-app hidden" id="quizApp">
        <header class="quiz-header">
            <div class="quiz-header-inner">
                <button class="hdr-btn" onclick="openPalette()"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i></button>
                <div class="hdr-brand">Coding Decoding - Lecture 3</div>
                <div class="hdr-timer"><i class="fas fa-stopwatch"></i> <span id="timerText">00:00</span></div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="quiz-main" id="quizMain"></main>

        <nav class="quiz-nav" id="quizNav">
            <div class="quiz-nav-inner">
                <button class="nav-btn prev" id="prevBtn" onclick="prevQuestion()"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Previous</button>
                <button class="nav-btn submit" onclick="openSubmitModal()"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Submit</button>
                <button class="nav-btn next" id="nextBtn" onclick="nextQuestion()"><span id="nextLabel">Next</span> <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="palette-overlay" id="paletteOverlay" onclick="closePalette()"></div>
    <aside class="palette-drawer" id="paletteDrawer">
        <div class="pal-head"><span>Questions</span><button onclick="closePalette()"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button></div>
        <div class="pal-grid" id="paletteGrid"></div>
    </aside>

    <div class="modal-overlay" id="submitModal">
        <div class="modal-box">
            <h3>Submit Test?</h3>
            <div class="modal-stats-grid">
                <div class="modal-stat"><div class="modal-stat-num" id="modalAttempted" style="color:var(--green)">0</div><div>Attempted</div></div>
                <div class="modal-stat"><div class="modal-stat-num" id="modalUnattempted" style="color:var(--text-muted)">0</div><div>Unattempted</div></div>
            </div>
            <button class="modal-btn confirm" onclick="confirmSubmit()">Yes, Finish</button>
            <button class="modal-btn cancel" onclick="closeSubmitModal()">Resume</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="results-screen" id="resultsScreen"><div class="results-box" id="resultsInner"></div></div>
    <div class="toast" id="toast"><span id="toastText"></span></div>

    <script>
        const QUESTIONS = [
            {
                e: "In a certain code language, 'LAMP' is coded as '5729' and 'RACK' is coded as '8371'. What is the code for 'A' in the given code language?",
                h: "एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, 'LAMP' को '5729' और 'RACK' को '8371' के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है। दी गई कूट भाषा में 'A' के लिए कूट क्या है?",
                oEn: ["5", "7", "3", "8"],
                oHi: ["5", "7", "3", "8"],
                a: 1,
                sE: "In 'LAMP' (5729) and 'RACK' (8371), the only common letter is 'A', and the only common digit in both codes is '7'. Hence, A = 7.",
                sH: "'LAMP' (5729) aur 'RACK' (8371) dono me common letter 'A' hai, aur dono numbers me common digit '7' hai. Isliye 'A' ka code 7 hoga."
            },
            {
                e: "In a certain code language, 'LION' is coded as '7294' and 'SOUP' is coded as '8591'. What is the code for 'O' in the given code language?",
                h: "एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, 'LION' को '7294' और 'SOUP' को '8591' के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है। दी गई कूट भाषा में 'O' के लिए कूट क्या है?",
                oEn: ["7", "9", "2", "5"],
                oHi: ["7", "9", "2", "5"],
                a: 1,
                sE: "In 'LION' (7294) and 'SOUP' (8591), the common letter is 'O', and the common digit in both code sets is '9'. Hence, O = 9.",
                sH: "'LION' (7294) aur 'SOUP' (8591) me common letter 'O' hai aur common digit '9' hai. Isliye 'O' ka code 9 hai."
            },
            {
                e: "In a certain code language, 'NICK' is coded as '2384' and 'SKIN' is coded as '4638'. What is the code for 'S' in that language?",
                h: "एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, 'NICK' को '2384' के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है और 'SKIN' को '4638' के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है। उस भाषा में 'S' के लिए कूट क्या है?",
                oEn: ["3", "8", "6", "2"],
                oHi: ["3", "8", "6", "2"],
                a: 2,
                sE: "Common letters between NICK and SKIN are N, I, K with corresponding common digits 2, 3, 8, 4 excluding 2. Thus {N, I, K} = {2, 3, 8, 4}. In SKIN (4638), the remaining unique letter is 'S' and the unique digit is '6'. Hence, S = 6.",
                sH: "NICK (2384) aur SKIN (4638) me N, I, K ke digits 3, 4, 8 common hain. SKIN me bacha hua akshar 'S' hai aur bachi hui digit '6' hai. Isliye S = 6."
            },
            {
                e: "In a code language, if MINT is written as M3I9N4T0, then what is the last digit for the code for TIGER in that same language?",
                h: "एक कूट भाषा में, यदि MINT को M3I9N4T0 लिखा जाता है, तो उसी भाषा में TIGER के अंतिम अक्षर का कूट क्या होगा?",
                oEn: ["5", "8", "4", "9"],
                oHi: ["5", "8", "4", "9"],
                a: 1,
                sE: "Each letter is followed by the unit digit of its alphabetical position: M(13)->3, I(9)->9, N(14)->4, T(20)->0. For TIGER, the last letter is R (position 18), unit digit is 8.",
                sH: "Har letter ke sath uski alphabetical position ka unit digit (ikayi ank) likha gaya hai: M(13)->3, I(9)->9, N(14)->4, T(20)->0. TIGER ka antim letter R(18) hai, jiska unit digit 8 hai."
            },
            {
                e: "If MIND is written as N14J10O15E5, then how would GAME be written?",
                h: "यदि MIND को N14J10O15E5 के रूप में लिखा जाता है, तो GAME को कैसे लिखा जाएगा?",
                oEn: ["H8B3N15F6", "H8B2N14F6", "H7B3N14F6", "H8B2N15F5"],
                oHi: ["H8B3N15F6", "H8B2N14F6", "H7B3N14F6", "H8B2N15F5"],
                a: 1,
                sE: "Each letter is shifted by +1 and then followed by the position of that new letter: M(+1)=N(14), I(+1)=J(10), N(+1)=O(15), D(+1)=E(5). For GAME: G(+1)=H(8), A(+1)=B(2), M(+1)=N(14), E(+1)=F(6) -> H8B2N14F6.",
                sH: "Har akshar me +1 karke naya letter aur uski position likhi gayi hai: G(+1)=H(8), A(+1)=B(2), M(+1)=N(14), E(+1)=F(6) -> H8B2N14F6."
            },
            {
                e: "If ACNE can be coded as 3, 7, 29, 11, then BOIL will be coded as:",
                h: "यदि ACNE को 3, 7, 29, 11 के रूप में कोडित किया जाता है, तो BOIL को कोडित किया जाएगा?",
                oEn: ["5, 29, 19, 27", "5, 29, 19, 25", "5, 31, 21, 25", "5, 31, 19, 25"],
                oHi: ["5, 29, 19, 27", "5, 29, 19, 25", "5, 31, 21, 25", "5, 31, 19, 25"],
                a: 3,
                sE: "Pattern: (Position * 2) + 1. A: 1*2+1=3, C: 3*2+1=7, N: 14*2+1=29, E: 5*2+1=11. For BOIL: B: 2*2+1=5; O: 15*2+1=31; I: 9*2+1=19; L: 12*2+1=25 -> 5, 31, 19, 25.",
                sH: "Pattern: (Alphabetical position * 2) + 1. B = 2*2+1 = 5; O = 15*2+1 = 31; I = 9*2+1 = 19; L = 12*2+1 = 25 -> 5, 31, 19, 25."
            },
            {
                e: "If BIRD can be coded as 5, 19, 37, 9, then ECHO will be coded as:",
                h: "यदि BIRD को 5, 19, 37, 9 के रूप में कोडित किया जाता है, तो ECHO को किस प्रकार कोडित किया जाएगा?",
                oEn: ["11, 7, 17, 31", "11, 7, 17, 29", "9, 7, 15, 31", "11, 9, 15, 31"],
                oHi: ["11, 7, 17, 31", "11, 7, 17, 29", "9, 7, 15, 31", "11, 9, 15, 31"],
                a: 0,
                sE: "Pattern: (Position * 2) + 1. B: 2*2+1=5, I: 9*2+1=19, R: 18*2+1=37, D: 4*2+1=9. For ECHO: E: 5*2+1=11, C: 3*2+1=7, H: 8*2+1=17, O: 15*2+1=31 -> 11, 7, 17, 31.",
                sH: "Pattern: (Position * 2) + 1. E = 5*2+1 = 11; C = 3*2+1 = 7; H = 8*2+1 = 17; O = 15*2+1 = 31 -> 11, 7, 17, 31."
            },
            {
                e: "If TIGER can be written as 2097518, how can LION be written?",
                h: "यदि TIGER को 2097518 के रूप में लिखा जा सकता है, तो LION को कैसे लिखा जाएगा?",
                oEn: ["1291514", "12915914", "1215914", "1291415"],
                oHi: ["1291514", "12915914", "1215914", "1291415"],
                a: 0,
                sE: "Direct standard positional values: T=20, I=9, G=7, E=5, R=18 -> 2097518. For LION: L=12, I=9, O=15, N=14 -> 1291514.",
                sH: "Sidha alphabetical positions ko joda gaya hai: L = 12, I = 9, O = 15, N = 14 -> 1291514."
            },
            {
                e: "If BRAVE can be written as 2181225, how can CHAIR be written?",
                h: "यदि BRAVE को 2181225 के रूप में लिखा जा सकता है, तो CHAIR को कैसे लिखा जाएगा?",
                oEn: ["3819118", "381918", "38181918", "3181918"],
                oHi: ["3819118", "381918", "38181918", "3181918"],
                a: 1,
                sE: "Direct positional values concatenated: B=2, R=18, A=1, V=22, E=5 -> 2181225. For CHAIR: C=3, H=8, A=1, I=9, R=18 -> 381918.",
                sH: "Aksharon ke sthan sammanan likhe gaye hain: C=3, H=8, A=1, I=9, R=18 -> 381918."
            },
            {
                e: "In a certain code language, \"LION\" is coded as \"50\" and \"BEAR\" is coded as \"26\". What is the code for \"TIGER\" in the given language?",
                h: "एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में, \"LION\" को \"50\" के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है और \"BEAR\" को \"26\" के रूप में कूट बद्ध किया जाता है। दी गई भाषा में \"TIGER\" के लिए कूट क्या है?",
                oEn: ["63", "61", "59", "67"],
                oHi: ["63", "61", "59", "67"],
                a: 2,
                sE: "Sum of positions: LION = 12 + 9 + 15 + 14 = 50. BEAR = 2 + 5 + 1 + 18 = 26. For TIGER = 20 + 9 + 7 + 5 + 18 = 59.",
                sH: "Alphabet positions ka yog: T(20) + I(9) + G(7) + E(5) + R(18) = 59."
            },
